      "sourceHash": "fe46902dfa0ad178",
      "translationZh": "和往常一样，所有详情都在 https://wonderrico.github.io/local_llm_benchmark/benchmark-main.html?filter=3.8 ，更多详情则在 https://wonderrico.github.io/local_llm_benchmark/benchmark-detail.html?filter=3.8",
